.claude/
# SuperDesign writes a repo analysis here (init/*.md, design-system.md) on its
# first run. It is a scratch artefact of the design agent, regenerated on
# demand, and it embeds a snapshot of component source — not something to carry
# in history.
.superdesign/

# playwright
apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/playwright-report/
infra/benchmarks/data/
